@startuml
' Pages (`newpage`) under one another, each with its heads and feet, its
' boxes and the bars still open; numbers in levels (`autonumber 1.1.1`,
' raised by `autonumber inc A`); bars opened by the calls themselves
' (`autoactivate`), a note beside a call that opened one.
title Checkout
autoactivate on
autonumber 1.1.1
participant Shopper
participant Shop
box "Back end" #LightBlue
participant Stock
participant Bank
end box
Shopper -> Shop : add to cart
note right: opens a bar
Shop -> Stock : reserve
return reserved
newpage Paying
autonumber inc A
Shop -> Bank : charge
Bank --> Shop : charged
return order placed
@enduml
